  },
  data: {
    LLM: "1. A reader ('Yomite') reads the first half (upper phrase) of a poem.\n2. Both players attempt to touch the grabbing card containing the second half (lower phrase).\n3. If you grab a card in your own territory, it is removed.\n4. If you grab a card in your opponent's territory, you send one card from your territory to theirs.\n5. **Otetsuki (Fault)**: Touching the wrong card results in a penalty (opponent sends a card).",
    Player: "1. A reader ('Yomite') reads the first half (upper phrase) of a poem.\n2. Both players attempt to touch the grabbing card containing the second half (lower phrase).\n3. If you grab a card in your own territory, it is removed.\n4. If you grab a card in your opponent's territory, you send one card from your territory to theirs.\n5. **Otetsuki (Fault)**: Touching the wrong card results in a penalty (opponent sends a card).",
    objective: 'Empty your territory of cards before your opponent.',
    gameplay: "1. A reader ('Yomite') reads the first half (upper phrase) of a poem.\n2. Both players attempt to touch the grabbing card containing the second half (lower phrase).\n3. If you grab a card in your own territory, it is removed.\n4. If you grab a card in your opponent's territory, you send one card from your territory to theirs.\n5. **Otetsuki (Fault)**: Touching the wrong card results in a penalty (opponent sends a card).",
    keyRules: [
      'Reader recites the first phrase of a poem; first to touch the matching Torifuda wins that card. Correct touch in your territory removes the card; correct touch in opponent territory lets you send one card from your territory to theirs. Wrong touch (otetsuki) gives the opponent a card. First to empty their territory wins.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
